   "大丈夫か？"
  ],
  "en": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/200/006c6",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "別に・・どうってことないわよ"
  ],
  "en": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/200/0070a",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
